    "text": "UIII KALENDAS MARTIAS, CATHEDRA SANCTI PETRI.\nWE CWE\u00d0A\u00fe ON GERIMCR\u00c6FTE CATHEDRA SANCTI PETRI seofon nihton er \u00feam mon\u00f0e \u00fee we\nNu synd sume men \u00fee nyton hw\u00e6t se nama getacna\u00f0.\nCathedra is gereht bisceopstol on Englisc, and se halga Petrus w\u00e6s ahafen on \u00feam d\u00e6ge on his\n\u00deone stol he ges\u00e6t seofon gear fullice, and si\u00f0\u00f0an gewende be Godes wissunge to \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6ran Rome\nHe ferde fram Antiochian for \u00fean \u00fee he w\u00e6s apostol and sceolde gehw\u00e6r gecuman and Cristendom\n\u00dea ges\u00e6t he on Rome o\u00f0er bisceopsetl, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t se arleasa Nero hine ahencg on rode.\nNu wylle we eow secgan sume Petres wundra, him to wur\u00f0mynte and eow to trymmincge, ac ure m\u00e6\u00f0\nWe s\u00e6don hwilon \u00e6r hu his sceadu gehealde ealle \u00fea untruman \u00fee heo oferglad, swa hw\u00e6r swa he\nNu wylle we eac eow secgan hu he sume d\u00e6g eode to \u00feam Godes temple mid \u00feam godspellere Iohanne.\n\u00dea l\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6r sum creopere lama fram cildhade, se w\u00e6s d\u00e6ghwamlice geboren to \u00feam beorhtan gete, \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00d0a beseah he to Petre sumere \u00e6lmessan wilnigende.\nPetrus so\u00felice cw\u00e6\u00f0, N\u00e6bbe ic seolfor ne gold, ic \u00fee do \u00fe\u00e6t ic h\u00e6bbe, aris on Drihtnes naman hal on\nAnd he leop sona cunnigende his fe\u00f0es, hw\u00e6\u00f0er he cu\u00f0e gan.\nEode \u00fea mid blisse binnan \u00feam temple mid \u00feam halgum apostolum, \u00feone h\u00e6lend herigende.\n\u00dea oncneowan hine ealle \u00fee hine cu\u00f0on \u00e6r, and micclum wundrodon \u00fe\u00e6s w\u00e6dlan h\u00e6le.\nEft \u00e6t sumon s\u00e6le \u00fea Petrus si\u00feode neosigenne \u00fea geleaffullan, \u00fea becom he to Liddan, wolde \u00f0a\n\u00dea gemette he anne b\u00e6drydan binnon \u00feam weallum, Eneas gehaten, for eahte gearum lama.\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se eadiga Petrus to \u00feam earman b\u00e6ddrydan, geh\u00e6le \u00f0e drihten Crist, aris and do \u00fee gearowne.\n\u00dea aras se b\u00e6ddryda unbunden fram Petre, se \u00fee h\u00e6f\u00f0 \u00fea mihte \u00fe\u00e6t he m\u00e6g unbinden \u00fea f\u00e6stan cnottan\n\u00dea gelyfde seo burhwaru, \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6s b\u00e6ddrydan h\u00e6le,on \u00feone so\u00f0an God, and gecyrde to fulluhte, and\nIoppe hatte sum burh, gehende \u00fe\u00e6re Liddan, on \u00fe\u00e6re w\u00e6s an wydewe wel gelyfed, Thabitas geciged,\nSeo wear\u00f0 geuntrumad on \u00feam ylcan timan, gewat \u00fea of life, and l\u00e6g on uppflora.\n\u00dea geaxodon \u00fea geleaffullan \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t lic bes\u00e6tan \u00fe\u00e6t Petrus w\u00e6s on Liddan, \u00feam lande swa gehende,\n\u00dea aras se apostol and ardlice \u00feider com, eode to \u00fe\u00e6re uppflora, and efne him embe stodon wepende\n\u00dea het se halga Petrus \u00fe\u00e6t hi him \u00fe\u00e6t hus gerymdon, and gebigde his cneowa biddende hire lifes.\nWende \u00fea to \u00feam lice and hlude clypode, Thabita aris, and heo \u00fe\u00e6rrihte geedcucode, beseah to Petre,\n\u00dea gel\u00e6hte Petrus hire li\u00feian hand, ar\u00e6rde hi upp hale of \u00feam bedde.\n\u00dea asprang \u00feis wundor wide geond \u00fe\u00e6t land, and fela gelyfdon on \u00feone lifigendan God.\n\u00dea wunode Petrus \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6re wydewan \u00e6ryste manega dagas on Ioppe, mid sumum gelyfedan menn,\n\u00dea wolde se apostol hine onsundron gebiddan, and astah to \u00fe\u00e6re uppflora embe midne d\u00e6g utan, w\u00e6s\n\u00dea wear\u00f0 him \u00e6teowed wundorlic gesih\u00f0, he geseah heofonas opene and him com to an f\u00e6t, fy\u00f0erscyte\nHim com stemn to, \u00feus clypiende \u00feriwa, aris nu Petrus, and \u00feas re\u00f0an deor ofsleh, maca \u00fee to mete, \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se halga wer, ne gewur\u00f0e hit, leof Drihten, for\u00fean \u00f0e ic ne onbyrgde swa hw\u00e6t swa uncl\u00e6ne\n\u00dea com him eft stemn to \u00feus clypigende of heofonum, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t God gecl\u00e6nsode, ne cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6t hit ful\n\u00deriwa him w\u00e6s \u00feus geclypod to, and \u00fe\u00e6rrihte wear\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t f\u00e6t upp to heofonum abroden, eft mid \u00feam\nWe wylla\u00f0 eow secgan sceortlice \u00feas getacnunge.\n\u00de\u00e6t fy\u00feerscyte f\u00e6t mid \u00feam fulum nytenum h\u00e6fde getacnunge ealles h\u00e6\u00f0enes folces, \u00fee on\nAnd for\u00fei cw\u00e6\u00fe se stemn clypigende to Petre, \u00fe\u00e6t he hine gereordode mid \u00feam re\u00feenum nytenum,\n\u00deriwa clypode seo stemn fram \u00fe\u00e6re halgan \u00f0rynnysse, seo \u00fee is an \u00e6lmihtig God \u00e6fre untod\u00e6ledlic.\nMid \u00feam \u00f0e Petrus smeade hw\u00e6t his gesih\u00f0 gem\u00e6nde, \u00fea clypodon \u00fe\u00e6r \u00f0ry weras, cnucigende \u00e6t \u00feam\nEfne \u00fea se halga gast him \u00fe\u00e6t s\u00e6de and cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fery weras \u00fee seca\u00f0, of Cessarean byrig, aris and far\nPetrus \u00fea eode ardlice to \u00f0am mannum, befran for hwylcum intingan hi hine axodon.\nHi s\u00e6don \u00fe\u00e6t Cornelius hi asende to him.\nHe is hundredes ealdor, and h\u00e6f\u00f0 Godes ege, swy\u00f0e rihtwys wer, \u00fe\u00e6t wat eall \u00feeos scyr.\nHim com to Godes \u00e6ncgel and cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he sceolde \u00fee him to langian, and \u00feine lare gehyran.\n\u00dea on \u00e6rnemergen eode se eadiga Petrus mid \u00feam \u00e6rendracum, and eac his gebro\u00f0ra samod to\nCornelius gela\u00f0ode his leofestan freond, wolde \u00fe\u00e6t hi gehyrdon \u00fea halgan lare \u00e6t Petre, and eode him\nEode \u00fea inn mid Cornelie, and cw\u00e6\u00f0 to him eallum, Ge witon \u00fe\u00e6t us Iudeiscum ne gedafena\u00f0 to\nIc com eac for\u00fey buton \u00e6lcere twynunge, ic axe \u00feone intingan, hwi \u00feu me gelangodest.\nCornelius cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fea, me com to Godes encgel nu \u00e6r on d\u00e6g embe nontid, \u00fea\u00fea ic me ana geb\u00e6d, stod\nAsend nu to Ioppen to Symone Petre, and gelange hine to \u00fee, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fee lifes word secge.\nNu sende ic to \u00fee and we synd gearwe ealle \u00fea \u00feincg to gehyrenne, \u00fee se h\u00e6lend \u00fee bebead.\nCristendom n\u00e6s \u00feagit cu\u00f0 on \u00fe\u00e6re byrig, ne \u00fees Cornelius n\u00e6s on Criste gefullod, ac he gelyfde swa\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se eadiga Petrus, Ic oncneow to so\u00fean \u00fe\u00e6t Gode is andfencge on \u00e6lcere m\u00e6g\u00f0e se\u00fee hine\nOngan \u00fea to secgenne \u00feone so\u00fean geleafan \u00feam h\u00e6\u00f0enan \u00feegne be \u00f0\u00e6s h\u00e6lendes f\u00e6re; hu he worhte\n\u00dea betwux \u00feysum wordum wear\u00fe mycel Godes wundor, swa \u00fe\u00e6t se halga gast com ofer \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0enan,\n\u00dea wundrodon \u00fea Iudeiscan \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6ran mid Petre, geleaffulle on Criste, \u00fe\u00e6t se halga gast com ofer\nAnd he sona het hi ealle fullian, on \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6lmihtigan naman.\n\u00dea b\u00e6don hi Petrum \u00fe\u00e6t he andbidode \u00fe\u00e6r ane feawa daga \u00e6fter heora fulluhte.\nEft \u00fea\u00f0a Petrus com to \u00feam Cristenum heape binnan Hierusalem, \u00fea befrunon \u00fea gebro\u00f0ra \u00fee of\n\u00dea Iudeiscan wendon \u00fe\u00e6t hi ana w\u00e6ron Gode gecorene, and for\u00fey swa cw\u00e6don.\nOn ealdum dagum under moyses \u00e6 noldon \u00fea Iudeiscan genealecan \u00feam h\u00e6\u00feenum, ne mid him\nNu woldon \u00f0a Iudesican heora gewunan healdan \u00e6fter heora fulluhte, and forseon \u00f0a h\u00e6\u00feenan.\n\u00dea began se halga Petrus him eallum secgan hw\u00e6t him God geswutelode \u00e6r\u00f0an \u00fee he \u00feider si\u00feode,\n\u00dea suwodon \u00fea Iudeiscan sy\u00f0\u00f0an hi \u00feis gehyrdon, and wuldrodon God, \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde forgifan \u00feam\nMarcellus w\u00e6s gehaten sum m\u00e6re Godes \u00feegn, se folgode Symone \u00feam sceandlican dry, o\u00f0\u00fe\u00e6t se\n\u00dea forlet Marcellus \u00feone manfullan dry, and folgode Petre and to fulluhte beah.\nNu awrat \u00fe\u00e6s Marcellus hu sancte Petres dohtor Petronella gewat of worulde to Criste.\nPetrus h\u00e6fde wif \u00e6r\u00f0an \u00fee he w\u00e6re gecyrred to Cristes hirede, ac he wi\u00fecw\u00e6\u00f0 si\u00f0\u00f0an woruldlicum\nEcce nos reliquimus omnia, et secuti sumus te; quid ergo erit nobis; Efne we forleton ealle \u00feincg on\nOn anginne middaneardes cw\u00e6\u00f0 se \u00e6lmihtiga God, Beo\u00f0 gemenigfylde and gefylla\u00f0 \u00feas eor\u00f0an.\nAnd Crist wolde on his tocyme cl\u00e6nnysse ar\u00e6ran, and his halgan hired heold on cl\u00e6nnysse.\nMenn h\u00e6fdon on frym\u00f0e heora magan to wife, and swa wel mosten for \u00f0\u00e6re wifleaste, and gif nu hwa\nUnder moyses \u00e6, moste se bisceop habban an gen\u00e6wnod wif, for \u00fe\u00e6re gewissan \u00e6ftergencgnysse, \u00fe\u00e6t\nHit mihte \u00fea wel swa, for \u00fean \u00fee hi ne m\u00e6ssodon n\u00e6fre, ac hi offrodon nytenu on heora lacum Gode.\nNe husel n\u00e6s gehalgod \u00e6r\u00feam \u00f0e se h\u00e6lend com, and \u00fea niwan gecy\u00f0nysse mid Cristendome ar\u00e6rde,\nAnd bisceopas ne beo\u00f0 nu be gebyrdum gecorene, ac seo halige gela\u00f0ung lufa\u00f0 \u00fea cl\u00e6nan, and Crist\nWe sceoldan secgan be \u00fe\u00e6re snoteran Petronellan, \u00fe\u00e6s eadigan Petres dehter, ac us bearn \u00feis on mod.\nSe fores\u00e6da Marcellus s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t heo l\u00e6ge on paralisin swa swa Petrus sylf wolde.\n\u00dea axode Titus \u00feone eadigan apostol, hwi he ge\u00feafode \u00fe\u00e6t heo swa lage on \u00feam legerbedde, \u00feonne he\n\u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 se halga f\u00e6der \u00fe\u00e6t hire fremode \u00fe\u00e6t, ac \u00feel\u00e6s \u00fee hwa wene \u00fe\u00e6t ure word ne m\u00e6ge hire\nAnd heo \u00fe\u00e6rrihte aras, \u00feenode hire f\u00e6der and his geferum hal.\n\u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6re \u00feenunge het se halga Petrus hi to bedde gan and beon eft seoc.\nHeo \u00feeah \u00f0a on Godes ege and God hi eft geh\u00e6lde, swa \u00fe\u00e6t heo sylf mihte manega o\u00f0re geh\u00e6len,\nHire w\u00e6s sum o\u00feer m\u00e6den geferl\u00e6ht Felicula gehaten, fulfremed on Godes ege and on ealre\nAc Petronella w\u00e6s swy\u00f0e wlitig on hiwe.\n\u00dea com sum heretoga se w\u00e6s gehaten Flaccus, mid mycelre fare to \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6ran Petronellan, wolde hi\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t halige m\u00e6den to \u00feam h\u00e6\u00feenan menn, hwi come \u00feu mid w\u00e6pnum and mid w\u00e6lreowum\nAc gif \u00f0u me habban wylt hat cuman to me \u00e6\u00f0elborenne wif and wlitige m\u00e6denu nu \u00e6fter \u00f0rym\nAnd he hire gelyfde.\nHw\u00e6t \u00fea Petronella mid f\u00e6stenum hi geb\u00e6d to \u00f0am heofonlican cynincge, \u00fee heo gecoren h\u00e6fde on\n\u00dea comon \u00fea wif swa heo h\u00e6fde gecw\u00e6den, and behwurfon hire lic o\u00fe\u00fe\u00e6t heo bebyrged w\u00e6s, swylce\n\u00dea awende se Flaccus to Feliculan his mod, and cw\u00e6\u00fe hire \u00feus to mid \u00ferutigendum mode, Geceos \u00fee\nAc heo him andwyrde \u00feus, Ne beo ic n\u00e6fre \u00fein wif, for\u00f0an \u00fee ic sylfwylles eom Criste gehalgod, ne ic\n\u00dea het se arleasa Flaccus \u00fea f\u00e6mnan gebringan on \u00feysterfullum cwearterne, and cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t man ne\nHeo wunode \u00fea swa seofon niht meteleas, and sy\u00f0\u00f0an wear\u00f0 getintregod for \u00fean so\u00f0an geleafan and\n\u00dea com Nicomedis se fores\u00e6da m\u00e6ssepreost, and bebyrgde hire lic to lofe \u00feam \u00e6lmihtigan.\n\u00dea gel\u00e6hte Flaccus \u00feone geleaffullan preost, and for\u00f0an \u00fee he nolde \u00feam fulum godum geoffrian, het\nHe gewat \u00fea to heofonan to h\u00e6lende Criste, \u00feam is wuldor and wur\u00f0mynt on ealra worulda",
